{"id": "babble_zh_01", "lang": "zh", "text": "请把窗户打开通风。", "voice": "sambert-zhiyue-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_02", "lang": "zh", "text": "这个周末天气不错。", "voice": "sambert-zhiying-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_03", "lang": "zh", "text": "我们需要提前订票。", "voice": "sambert-zhiming-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_04", "lang": "zh", "text": "楼下的超市在打折。", "voice": "sambert-zhinan-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_05", "lang": "zh", "text": "他的办公室在三楼。", "voice": "sambert-zhimao-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_06", "lang": "zh", "text": "这本书写得很有意思。", "voice": "sambert-zhiqi-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_07", "lang": "zh", "text": "别忘了带充电器。", "voice": "sambert-zhiyue-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_08", "lang": "zh", "text": "晚饭想吃点清淡的。", "voice": "sambert-zhiying-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_09", "lang": "zh", "text": "会议记录我整理好了。", "voice": "sambert-zhiming-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_10", "lang": "zh", "text": "院子里种了些花草。", "voice": "sambert-zhinan-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_11", "lang": "zh", "text": "这条裙子颜色好看。", "voice": "sambert-zhimao-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_12", "lang": "zh", "text": "公交车还有三站到。", "voice": "sambert-zhiqi-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_13", "lang": "zh", "text": "咖啡不加糖谢谢。", "voice": "sambert-zhiyue-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_14", "lang": "zh", "text": "电脑重新启动试试。", "voice": "sambert-zhiying-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_15", "lang": "zh", "text": "外套挂在门后面。", "voice": "sambert-zhiming-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_16", "lang": "zh", "text": "行李箱密码忘了。", "voice": "sambert-zhinan-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_17", "lang": "zh", "text": "下午有个电话会议。", "voice": "sambert-zhimao-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_18", "lang": "zh", "text": "图书馆座位挺多的。", "voice": "sambert-zhiqi-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_19", "lang": "zh", "text": "雨伞放门口伞架了。", "voice": "sambert-zhiyue-v1"}
{"id": "babble_zh_20", "lang": "zh", "text": "这集电视剧很精彩。", "voice": "sambert-zhiying-v1"}
{"id": "babble_en_01", "lang": "en", "text": "Please close the door quietly.", "voice": "sambert-cindy-v1"}
